window.KINESICA_GOOGLE_REVIEWS={placeId:"ChIJZ2mPW9K1vJUR3J5kGRi5gws",fetchedAt:"2026-11-14T01:20:53.347Z",displayName:"Kinesica",googleMapsUri:"https://maps.google.com/?cid=829710269522681564&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA",rating:5,userRatingCount:37,reviews:[{author:"Mario Schonfeld",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvo1RJ2skq3nr_pJRwvQZNdUrw77voXh3yGLaVweufqb-vbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116485618727629391879/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude me atiende hace mucho tiempo. Conf\xEDo en el plenamente. Adem\xE1s es un profesional que atiende a un paciente por sesi\xF3n dedic\xE1ndose completamente y con seriedad absoluta",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace una semana",publishTime:"2026-11-03T00:13:29.224441962Z"},{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto me ayud\xF3 mucho y saco dolores dorsales y de rodilla que venia padeciendo. El trato muy amigable y profesional. Lo recomiendo completamente!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 3 semanas",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Muy contenta con la atenci\xF3n. Norberto destaca por su profesionalismo, puntualidad y trato cercano. Me ayud\xF3 mucho con mi recuperaci\xF3n mediante un tratamiento personalizado. Totalmente recomendable si busc\xE1s un especialista de confianza.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 2 meses",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",language:"es"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",language:"es"}],byLang:{es:[{author:"Mario Schonfeld",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvo1RJ2skq3nr_pJRwvQZNdUrw77voXh3yGLaVweufqb-vbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116485618727629391879/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude me atiende hace mucho tiempo. Conf\xEDo en el plenamente. Adem\xE1s es un profesional que atiende a un paciente por sesi\xF3n dedic\xE1ndose completamente y con seriedad absoluta",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace una semana",publishTime:"2026-11-03T00:13:29.224441962Z"},{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto me ayud\xF3 mucho y saco dolores dorsales y de rodilla que venia padeciendo. El trato muy amigable y profesional. Lo recomiendo completamente!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 3 semanas",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Muy contenta con la atenci\xF3n. Norberto destaca por su profesionalismo, puntualidad y trato cercano. Me ayud\xF3 mucho con mi recuperaci\xF3n mediante un tratamiento personalizado. Totalmente recomendable si busc\xE1s un especialista de confianza.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 2 meses",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",language:"es"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",language:"es"}],en:[{author:"Mario Schonfeld",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvo1RJ2skq3nr_pJRwvQZNdUrw77voXh3yGLaVweufqb-vbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116485618727629391879/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude has been my doctor for a long time. I trust him completely. He's also a professional who sees one patient per session, dedicating himself fully and with absolute seriousness.",language:"en",relativeTime:"a week ago",publishTime:"2026-11-03T00:13:29.224441962Z"},{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto helped me a lot and relieved the back and knee pain I'd been suffering from. He was very friendly and professional. I highly recommend him!",language:"en",relativeTime:"3 weeks ago",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"I'm very happy with the service. Norberto stands out for his professionalism, punctuality, and friendly approach. He greatly helped my recovery with a personalized treatment plan. I highly recommend him if you're looking for a trustworthy specialist.",language:"en",relativeTime:"2 months ago",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"I've been coming here for years, and Norberto's care is excellent. He knows how to listen so he can decide where to focus the work, and he uses a range of techniques according to the patient's needs. I always left feeling better than when I arrived. I recommend him highly!!!!!",language:"en"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incredibly surprised, in a good way: I had epicondylitis pain for 3 years, and after just 2 sessions with kinesiologist Norberto Brude I have no pain, I was able to go back to training, I used to wake up with a numb hand and it hasn't happened again! Truly an outstanding professional, and above all he brought calm when I needed it most.",language:"en"}],fr:[{author:"Laurence Hamon",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKl_d7ICqQMOauSKBwMImTq5Wu3WONxcY5h2vpYCMW3nCqRgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103467292555735082210/reviews",rating:5,text:`Super !
Efficace, tr\xE8s comp\xE9tente, attentive, des r\xE9sultats sans brusquerie.. dommage qu\u2019elle ne soit pas en France pr\xE8s de chez moi!`,language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a moins d'une semaine",publishTime:"2026-11-13T14:17:37.188096687Z"},{author:"Mario Schonfeld",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvo1RJ2skq3nr_pJRwvQZNdUrw77voXh3yGLaVweufqb-vbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116485618727629391879/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude est mon m\xE9decin depuis longtemps. J'ai une confiance totale en lui. C'est un professionnel qui ne re\xE7oit qu'un seul patient par s\xE9ance, se consacrant pleinement et avec un s\xE9rieux absolu.",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a une semaine",publishTime:"2026-11-03T00:13:29.224441962Z"},{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto m'a beaucoup aid\xE9 et a soulag\xE9 mes douleurs au dos et au genou. Il \xE9tait tr\xE8s sympathique et professionnel. Je le recommande vivement !",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a 3\xA0semaines",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Je suis tr\xE8s satisfait du service. Norberto se distingue par son professionnalisme, sa ponctualit\xE9 et sa gentillesse. Il a grandement contribu\xE9 \xE0 ma gu\xE9rison gr\xE2ce \xE0 un plan de traitement personnalis\xE9. Je le recommande vivement si vous recherchez un sp\xE9cialiste de confiance.",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a 2\xA0mois",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Je viens le consulter depuis des ann\xE9es, et l'accompagnement de Norberto est excellent. Il sait \xE9couter pour d\xE9terminer sur quels points concentrer le travail, et il ma\xEEtrise diverses techniques qu'il utilise selon les besoins du patient. Je suis toujours sortie de la s\xE9ance mieux qu'\xE0 l'arriv\xE9e. Je le recommande vivement !!!!!",language:"fr"}],pt:[{author:"Mario Schonfeld",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvo1RJ2skq3nr_pJRwvQZNdUrw77voXh3yGLaVweufqb-vbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116485618727629391879/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude \xE9 meu m\xE9dico h\xE1 muito tempo. Confio nele plenamente. Ele tamb\xE9m \xE9 um profissional que atende um paciente por consulta, dedicando-se integralmente e com absoluta seriedade.",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 uma semana",publishTime:"2026-11-03T00:13:29.224441962Z"},{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto me ajudou muito e aliviou as dores nas costas e nos joelhos que eu vinha sentindo. Ele foi muito simp\xE1tico e profissional. Recomendo-o fortemente!",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 3 semanas",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Estou muito satisfeita com o servi\xE7o. Norberto se destaca pelo profissionalismo, pontualidade e cordialidade. Ele contribuiu muito para a minha recupera\xE7\xE3o com um plano de tratamento personalizado. Recomendo-o fortemente se voc\xEA procura um especialista de confian\xE7a.",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 2 meses",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Venho h\xE1 anos, e o atendimento do Norberto \xE9 excelente. Ele sabe escutar para definir em que pontos focar o trabalho e conhece diversas t\xE9cnicas que usa conforme a necessidade do paciente. Sempre sa\xED da consulta me sentindo melhor do que no in\xEDcio. Recomendo muit\xEDssimo!!!!!",language:"pt"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incrivelmente surpreso, para melhor: levei 3 anos com dor por epicondilite e, em apenas 2 sess\xF5es com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude, n\xE3o tenho mais dor, pude voltar a treinar, acordava com a m\xE3o dormente e isso n\xE3o voltou a acontecer! Sinceramente um profissional fora de s\xE9rie, e acima de tudo soube trazer calma quando mais eu precisava.",language:"pt"}]},translations:{"mariana gonzalez cadahia":{es:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",en:"I've been coming here for years, and Norberto's care is excellent. He knows how to listen so he can decide where to focus the work, and he uses a range of techniques according to the patient's needs. I always left feeling better than when I arrived. I recommend him highly!!!!!",fr:"Je viens le consulter depuis des ann\xE9es, et l'accompagnement de Norberto est excellent. Il sait \xE9couter pour d\xE9terminer sur quels points concentrer le travail, et il ma\xEEtrise diverses techniques qu'il utilise selon les besoins du patient. Je suis toujours sortie de la s\xE9ance mieux qu'\xE0 l'arriv\xE9e. Je le recommande vivement !!!!!",pt:"Venho h\xE1 anos, e o atendimento do Norberto \xE9 excelente. Ele sabe escutar para definir em que pontos focar o trabalho e conhece diversas t\xE9cnicas que usa conforme a necessidade do paciente. Sempre sa\xED da consulta me sentindo melhor do que no in\xEDcio. Recomendo muit\xEDssimo!!!!!"},"gabriel rotman":{es:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",en:"Incredibly surprised, in a good way: I had epicondylitis pain for 3 years, and after just 2 sessions with kinesiologist Norberto Brude I have no pain, I was able to go back to training, I used to wake up with a numb hand and it hasn't happened again! Truly an outstanding professional, and above all he brought calm when I needed it most.",fr:"Agr\xE9ablement surpris, au-del\xE0 de toute attente : je souffrais d'une \xE9picondylite depuis 3 ans, et en \xE0 peine 2 s\xE9ances avec le kin\xE9sith\xE9rapeute Norberto Brude je n'ai plus de douleur, j'ai pu reprendre l'entra\xEEnement, je me r\xE9veillais avec la main endormie et cela ne s'est plus reproduit ! Un professionnel hors pair, et surtout il a su m'apporter du calme quand j'en avais le plus besoin.",pt:"Incrivelmente surpreso, para melhor: levei 3 anos com dor por epicondilite e, em apenas 2 sess\xF5es com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude, n\xE3o tenho mais dor, pude voltar a treinar, acordava com a m\xE3o dormente e isso n\xE3o voltou a acontecer! Sinceramente um profissional fora de s\xE9rie, e acima de tudo soube trazer calma quando mais eu precisava."}}};
